COMPILATION OF: E52PN

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PN

   1 a 0000 E52PN: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E52PN (FILE route, picture-only format table; expect the same
   3 a 0006       12-byte table as E52PM) */
   4 a 0006    /* P3-3 file-route probes: f declared file, NO open (P086K
   5 a 0006       attaches without one, [C282]). */
   6 c 0006    dcl f file, d fixed decimal(4,2);
   7 c 0006    put file(f) edit(d)(p'9V.99');
   8 a 002D end E52PN;

CODE SIZE = 0030
DATA AREA = 000F
FREE SYMS = 38C9
END  COMPILATION
